{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormulaBetaProd","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormulaBetaProd","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormulaBeta","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityIContentDecomposition"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooks_mul_betaGapProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooks_mul_betaGapProd","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaBetaProd.lean#L112-L133","doc":"**Full Frame–Robinson–Thrall hook product, divisor-free (sorry-free).** For every\nweakly-decreasing partition `l`,\n\n    prodHooks l · (∏_{i<|l|} betaGapProd (l[i]) (l.drop (i+1)))\n      = ∏_{i<|l|} (l[i] + (l.drop (i+1)).length)!  =  ∏_i β_i!.\n\nThis is the hook-side identity (i) of the beta-number route to the general HLF:\n`∏_c h_λ(c) = (∏_i β_i!) / ∏_{i<j}(β_i − β_j)`, cleared of the Vandermonde denominator.  Sorry-free\nfor every weakly-decreasing positive partition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.drop_le_getD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.drop_le_getD","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaBetaProd.lean#L98-L110","doc":"Every part of the tail of row `i` is `≤ l[i]` (weakly-decreasing). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.drop_sorted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.drop_sorted","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaBetaProd.lean#L93-L96","doc":"The tail of row `i` is weakly-decreasing (a suffix of a weakly-decreasing list). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooks_eq_prod_rowHookProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooks_eq_prod_rowHookProd","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaBetaProd.lean#L77-L91","doc":"**`prodHooks` as a product of per-row `rowHookProd` (sorry-free).** For a weakly-decreasing `l`,\n\nprodHooks l = ∏_{i<|l|} rowHookProd (l[i]) (l.drop (i+1)).\n\nEach outer factor of the corpus `prodHooks` is rewritten by `prodHooks_row_eq_rowHookProd`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooks_row_eq_rowHookProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooks_row_eq_rowHookProd","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaBetaProd.lean#L60-L75","doc":"**Row-`i` factor of `prodHooks` as a `rowHookProd` (sorry-free).** For a weakly-decreasing `l` and\n`i < l.length`, the row-`i` hook product appearing in `prodHooks l` equals\n`rowHookProd (l.getD i 0) (l.drop (i+1))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.colLen_eq_succ_add_cnt_drop","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.colLen_eq_succ_add_cnt_drop","kind":"theorem","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaBetaProd.lean#L29-L58","doc":"**Leg simplification (sorry-free).** For a weakly-decreasing `l`, `i < l.length` and `j < l[i]`,\nevery row `0,…,i` reaches column `j` (its length is `≥ l[i] > j`), so\n`colLen l j = (i + 1) + cnt (l.drop (i+1)) j`.  Hence the corpus leg `colLen l j − i − 1` is exactly\nthe tail count `cnt (l.drop (i+1)) j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.cnt_eq_colLen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.cnt_eq_colLen","kind":"theorem","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaBetaProd.lean#L26-L27","doc":"`cnt` (this file's leg count) and the corpus `colLen` are the same `filter`-length. ","signatureChunk":0}]}